    "upstream_operation": "RSA sigVer FIPS186-5 GDT (dedicated SigVer vectors with upstream testPassed + reason)",
    "local_operation": "C_CreateObject(CKO_PUBLIC_KEY, CKK_RSA, CKA_MODULUS = n, CKA_PUBLIC_EXPONENT = e) then C_VerifyInit + C_Verify(message, signature): pkcs1v1.5/SHA2-256 -> CKM_SHA256_RSA_PKCS; pss/SHA3-256/mgf1 -> CKM_SHA3_256_RSA_PKCS_PSS with CK_RSA_PKCS_PSS_PARAMS{CKM_SHA3_256, CKG_MGF1_SHA3_256, sLen = saltLen}. CKR_OK required for testPassed=true, CKR_SIGNATURE_INVALID for testPassed=false",
    "transformation": "subset only; every retained field is byte-copied from the upstream file (values are strings upstream, kept as strings); no value is re-derived",
    "subset_policy": "Deterministic. For each (modulus, sigType, hashAlg, maskFunction, saltLen) combination PKCS#11 v3.2 can express — PKCS#1 v1.5 with SHA2-256 at 2048/3072/4096 bits and PSS with SHA3-256 + MGF1 at 2048 bits — the first upstream group (one public exponent) with all 6 of its cases (1 valid + message, key, signature, IR-trailer and IR-location modifications). PSS groups hashing with SHAKE-128/256 or masking with SHAKE-128/256 are listed in notExecuted: PKCS#11 v3.2 has no RSA mechanism or CKG_MGF for them.",
    "retained_fields": "tgId group fields (sigType, modulo, hashAlg, maskFunction, saltLen, n, e); tcId, testPassed, reason, message, signature",
    "negative_classes_upstream": [
      "Message modified",
      "Key modified",
      "Signature modified",
      "IR trailer modified from expected value",
      "IR moved from expected location"
    ]
  },
